Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 09:48:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 016/154] atrium: command-bar bridge
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

260.1: widen the match payload additively - deletable, inline_autocompletion,
fill_into_edit, allowed_to_be_default_match, contents/description
classifications, favicon/image url, stripped_destination_url. 260.9: forward
intermediate AutocompleteController passes as provisional-vs-final envelopes
with a query generation so Swift's typing gate can drop stale passes. 260.8:
thread an open reason (kNewTab/kEditCurrentURL) through a controller latch
into the show path, with a cmd+l native hotkey. ABI additions are append-only.

Signed-off-by: János Mikó <693558+janosmiko@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 chrome/browser/ui/BUILD.gn | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/ui/BUILD.gn b/chrome/browser/ui/BUILD.gn
